                            The package of CubeSat subsystems structures:
                            Mission Payload
                            Command and Data Handling
                            Communication
                            Attitude Determination and Control
                            Guidance Navigation and Control
                            Structures and Mechanisms
                            Power
                            Thermal
                            Propulsion
                            Comment _19_0_3_2b0010b_1619533481548_623077_14698 (HowTo)
                            Select CubeSat Subsystems Structures Table / Select in Containment Tree to locate Subsystems pkg in the Containment tree
                            Open the CubeSat Subsystems Structures table and select Add New to add a new subsystem the containment tree and to the table.
                            Drag the new subsystem element from the containment tree to the CubeSat Subsystems bdd
                            Drag the new subsystem element from the containment tree to the Space Segment bdd.
                            Right click the Cubesat block and select directed composition and drag to the new subsystem element.
                            Open the CubeSat Structures Table and right click on Refresh to make the new subsystem a CubeSat part.
                            Comment _19_0_2_3880181_1637333440978_181346_55897 (Explanation)
                            CubeSat Subsystems - Population
                            UML kind: uml:Package */
