                            The package of Ground subsystems structures:
                            Plan and Schedule
                            Spacecraft Command
                            Ground Equipment Control
                            Space - Ground Communication
                            Mission Data Processing
                            Mission Data Dissemination
                            Network
                            Comment _19_0_3_2b0010b_1619901958651_110787_1202 (HowTo)
                            Select Ground Subsystems Structures Table / Select in Containment Tree to locate Subsystems pkg in the Containment tree
                            Open the Ground Subsystems Structures Table and select Add New to add a new subsystem to the containment tree and to the table.
                            Drag the new subsystem element from the containment tree to the Ground Subsystems bdd
                            Drag the new subsystem element from the containment tree to the Ground Segment bdd.
                            Right click the Ground Segment block and select directed composition and drag to the new subsystem element.
                            Open the Ground Segment Structures Table and right click on Refresh to make the new subsystem a Ground Segment part.
                            Comment _19_0_2_3880181_1637334736623_916214_56102 (Explanation)
                            Ground Subsystems - Popuation
